    {
      "id": "0ec56d3bc79646a29e81b267da204319",
      "text": "Lack of discipline can lead to decline and failure",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 73
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "4e990ebe85134f56b0ab62df0029072d",
      "text": "Overemphasis on discipline without understanding of the three circles can lead to short-term gains but long-term decline",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 73
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "e4685bbd033841af88a465a01ff847be",
      "text": "Leaders must balance discipline with understanding of the three circles to achieve sustained great results",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 73
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "72afc27d3e1d429a8b16a9addb66083a",
      "text": "Lack of discipline can lead to failure",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 75
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "0feef29f0a3e4f12a0f48d5f106b5434",
      "text": "Diversification without discipline can be disastrous",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 75
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "819797567d7a4fa7af562b52b1ad07db",
      "text": "Opportunity selection is crucial for success",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 75
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "658acd7b20b04497984b1e2865e40206",
      "text": "Prioritizing social hierarchy and class distinctions can lead to decline",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 75
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "85cbf1a25f684ea6a1555167d0532070",
      "text": "Neglecting employee welfare and interests can have severe consequences",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 75
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "99418ed82f8440b49b27fa4f927599ff",
      "text": "Leadership must be willing to make extreme sacrifices to achieve consistency with the company's values",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 75
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "ef0311d273234d06967cc5b9b96bafbe",
      "text": "Diversification can be a hindrance to success",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 76
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "018f35a47c8344f9804d58969c2e0cf9",
      "text": "Being right is not that hard if you have all the pieces in place",
      "source": {
        "book": "Collins-2001-Good-to-Great-Why-Some-Companies-Make-the-Leap...and-Others-Dont_",
        "chapter": 76
      },
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "ad09908270d949a1b0420d460a7939f3",
